    {
      "id": "maribell-counterattack-and-fixed-damage",
      "title": {
        "en": "Maribell Counterattack and Fixed Damage"
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "deck",
          "cards": [
            {
              "cardId": "c_1028_srt4",
              "name": "Resolute Blitz",
              "cost": 1
            },
            {
              "cardId": "c_1028_uni4",
              "name": "Shelter Strike",
              "cost": 1
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "Maribell's kit centers around Counterattacks\nCounterattacks are a buff that procs when an enemy hits your team\n(Every hit of a multi hit counts multiple times)\nWhen a counterattack is triggered the owner deals an attack of Def Based Dmg\nCounterattacks deal 1.5x? damage if the enemy hit is fully blocked by Shield\nCounterattacks can Crit\nCounterattacks are not Extra Attacks\nShelter Strike is a bit special, it is a Fixed Damage attack\nFixed Damage attacks cannot be altered by Buffs or Debuffs\nOnly Elemental%, Base stats and Crit can alter the damage"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
